"received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HBLADEH/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HBLADEH/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HBLADEH/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HBLADEH/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HBLADEH","user_view_type":"public"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HBLADEH/Dota2UID/releases/assets/631605368"}],"assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HBLADEH/Dota2UID/releases/409873538/assets","author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27012363?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HBLADEH/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HBLADEH/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HBLADEH/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HBLADEH/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HBLADEH","id":27012363,"login":"HBLADEH","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDEyMzYz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HBLADEH/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HBLADEH/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HBLADEH/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HBLADEH/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HBLADEH/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HBLADEH","user_view_type":"public"},"body":"Dota2UID 0.1.0a13 更新 README 与效果展示，功能、配置和数据格式沿用现有实现。\n\n- 整理功能、安装、命令、配置、数据来源和更新说明。\n- 新增七张“远古锻炉”主题实机截图：玩家、近期战绩、菜单、三页比赛报告与热门出装。图片来自 GsCore / Dota2UID，身份字段已脱敏，AstrBot 共用并注明来源。\n- 修正独立分发中的图片、安装和源码文档链接；AstrBot 顶部导航居中，Cloud 图片使用完整地址。\n\n运行组件：适配器 0.1.0a13、Core 0.1.0a7、Renderer 0.1.0a6、Assets 0.1.0a1。三个共享组件的 wheel 和源码包与上一版字节一致。\n\n按 INSTALL.md 使用随包运行库；旧 a6–a9 首次升级需冷启动，兼容的新随包代际可受控重载。需要 Python 3.12+、GsCore 及兼容的 HTTPX/Pillow。 配置、绑定和订阅数据应保留；详细步骤见仓库 INSTALL.md。\n\n验证：统一禁网测试 2013 项通过，覆盖率 92.52%；最终分发专项 89 项、五包构建、隔离安装和双端 SDK-free 分发 smoke 通过。源码 PR 的 Python 3.12／3.13 四项 CI 均通过。未操作真实宿主或验收主动订阅投递。\n\n[源码提交](https://github.com/HBLADEH/Dota2Forge/commit/15e1a50a07273c645f0a1066b61fe266dde216cc) · [分发提交](https://github.com/HBLADEH/Dota2UID/commit/72259b18d98199d9b883da7bee48d5783cdc769f)\n\n附件含插件 ZIP、四个运行 wheel、四个源码包、release-assets.json 与 SHA256SUMS，共 11 项。当前仍为 M0 预发行。\n","created_at":"2026-10-11T19:25:44Z","draft":true,"html_url":"https://github.com/HBLADEH/Dota2UID/releases/tag/untagged-e52b0b238dab843937a0","id":409873538,"immutable":false,"name":"Dota2UID 0.1.0a13 — README 与截图更新","node_id":"RE_kwDOU9Bnf84YbiyC","prerelease":true,"published_at":null,"tag_name":"v0.1.0a13","tarball_url":null,"target_commitish":"main","updated_at":"2026-10-11T19:26:52Z","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/HBLADEH/Dota2UID/releases/409873538/assets{?name,label}","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HBLADEH/Dota2UID/releases/409873538","zipball_url":null}
